[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Version=1.0
Name=Three-finger Drag Settings
Name[zh_CN]=三指拖移设置
Comment=Enable or disable macOS-style three-finger drag
Comment[zh_CN]=打开/关闭三指拖移，调整跟手速度
